{"id":"c9318869-f987-4a67-a11f-158699b9f847","title":"Offsets 6","slug":"offsets-6","collectionSlug":"offsets","collectionName":"Offsets","category":"background","categoryZh":"背景动画","description":"A flowing gradient shader effect dominated by warm tones transitioning from pale yellow-white on the left to vibrant orange on the right. The composition features a FlowingGradient base layer with colors progressing from white (#ffffff) through pale yellow (#fced77) to burnt orange (#ff8e4d) and deeper orange (#ff9e2b). The gradient creates smooth, organic color transitions across the canvas. Overlaid on this base are rectangular geometric shapes with soft, blurred edges creating a layered, translucent effect. A BarShift component with 6 vertical bars adds subtle horizontal striations with mirror-edge behavior. The GridDistortion effect with a decay of 8.3 and intensity of 1.5 introduces organic warping and distortion to the rectangular shapes, creating soft, undulating boundaries rather than sharp edges. The grid size of 6 creates visible cell-like divisions that are subtly warped. A BlueNoise overlay at 25% opacity with overlay blend mode adds fine grain texture and subtle contrast variation throughout, creating a slightly noisy, organic quality to the otherwise smooth gradients. The overall effect is warm, atmospheric, and slightly ethereal with soft edges and flowing transitions. The spatial arrangement shows lighter tones concentrated on the left side with progressively warmer, more saturated oranges dominating the right and bottom portions.","colors":["#ffffff","#fced77","#ff8e4d","#ff9e2b"],"labels":["gradient","organic","glowing","textured"],"cover":"/shaders/covers/c9318869-f987-4a67-a11f-158699b9f847.jpg","toneMapping":"neutral","components":[{"type":"FlowingGradient","id":"idmsq3j7yazb9j5e4jd","_key":"key_msq3j7yazb9j5e4jd","props":{"seed":0,"speed":3.5,"colorA":"#ffffff","colorB":"#fced77","colorC":"#ff8e4d","colorD":"#ff9e2b","opacity":1,"maskType":"alpha","bl